\f1\fs22 Gerry Hardman sat at the head of a long conference table, chairing the HIBReLabs status meeting. \'93Under no circumstances are we to risk damaging Jamison Tower,\'94 he reiterated, to a roomful of relieved sighs. \'93That is the CEO\'92s explicit instruction.\'94 
\f2\i For now,
\f1\i0  he didn\'92t add. That left one site for investigation: the one in the Pale, under some of the most exclusive towers in Ulyssia.\
